{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2021-12-31 08:57:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF SALE OF QUESTAR PIPELINES TO SOUTHWEST GAS', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA., DEC. 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINION ENERGY (NYSE: D) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS CLOSED THE SALE OF QUESTAR PIPELINES TO SOUTHWEST GAS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: SWX), IN A TRANSACTION VALUED AT $1.975 BILLION, INCLUDING THE ASSUMPTION OF $430 MILLION OF EXISTING DEBT.'}